OL,3,GNEWSABattling heatwave havoc, giant veg
OL,4,Agrowers prepare for judgement
OL,5,
OL,6,FAcross allotments and deep in the heart
OL,7,Fof gardens, excitement is building
OL,8,Fahead of a big date in the calendar -
OL,9,Fthe Canna UK National Giant Vegetables
OL,10,FChampionship, later this month.
OL,12,FFor the many who spend months tending
OL,13,Ftheir plants to get their vegetables as
OL,14,Fbig as possible, the time for judging
OL,15,Fis nigh, with the show starting on 25
OL,16,FSeptember.
OL,18,FTake for instance Neil Hands - talk to
OL,19,Fhim about why he gave up coaching a
OL,20,Fchildren's football team to take on his
OL,21,Fown allotment and that is when he
OL,22,Freally lights up.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
