OL,5,
OL,6,FEighteen years into his
OL,7,Fvegetable-growing journey, he said his
OL,8,Fproudest moment was winning a Guinness
OL,9,FWorld Record four years in a row, for
OL,10,Fthe biggest red cabbage.
